cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this benchmark or its artifacts, cite it as below. A specific .urna file is identified by its file_hash, listed in release/v0.1/<build>/SHA256SUMS; the corpus every v0.1 build holds is identified by its corpus_hash. Cite Urna, the engine that builds and reads the files, as listed under references. The seven source datasets keep their own licenses and authors, listed per source in docs/sources.md; the MIT license of this repo covers the code and results, not the corpus text."
type: dataset
title: "fakenews-ptbr-urna-benchmark"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-10-02
repository-code: "https://github.com/brennercruvinel/fakenews-ptbr-urna-benchmark"
url: "https://huggingface.co/datasets/brennercruvinel/fakenews-ptbr-urna-benchmark"
authors:
  - given-names: Brenner
    family-names: Cruvinel
    alias: Brenner Viana Cruvinel
    orcid: https://orcid.org/0009-0002-3079-8829
    affiliation: Hoff Research
    website: https://brennercruvinel.dev
abstract: "Retrieval benchmark of seven public Brazilian Portuguese fake-news datasets, deduplicated into one corpus of 23,335 documents and packed into single-file .urna containers, with 2,601 queries and silver relevance judgments. Every source is pinned to a revision and a tree hash; three example embedders (mpnet, minilm, potion) at three presets (exact, tiny, hybrid) are scored on nDCG@10 and recall@k, with rank stability and a clean-install check."
keywords:
  - fake news
  - brazilian portuguese
  - information retrieval
  - relevance judgments
  - embeddings
  - vector database
  - single-file container
  - reproducibility
identifiers:
  - type: other
    value: "sha256:e884b982900332aa331dc43653e6012396ed677bda9189515cc40a751393cb2a"
    description: "corpus_hash of the 23,335-document corpus every v0.1 build holds"
references:
  - type: software
    title: "Urna"
    abstract: "Offline-first vector database that stores text chunks, embeddings, source spans, indices and a search contract in a single .urna file. The v0.1 files were built with urna 0.5.1 (environment.packages.urna in each build.lock.json)."
    authors:
      - given-names: Brenner
        family-names: Cruvinel
        orcid: https://orcid.org/0009-0002-3079-8829
        affiliation: Hoff Research
    repository-code: "https://github.com/hoffresearch/urna"
    url: "https://urna.dev"
    license: MIT
